<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices unchanged in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices unchanged in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for ammonia and diammonium phosphate (DAP) were unchanged Monday in lackluster trading, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>Trade sources continued to monitor wet weather in the U.S. Midwest and southeast, which was delaying fertilizer application, dealers said.</p>
<p>			  Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  174-176		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    185-187		     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		197		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
